title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/ddp_poster_11.jpeg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for newspapers and radio.

= Media

The liberal press are scattered across the nation, most of them are nominally independent, but are de facto controlled by our members. We could use these media for various purposes...

- @berlinertagblad
- @diehilfe
- @echoderjungedemokratie
- @partymedia
- @integrate1
- @integrate2
- @bolsterpartymedia
- @debate
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@berlinertagblad
title: Fund the Berliner Tageblatt
subtitle: -1 resource. The biggest left-liberal publisher in Germany, edited by prominent DDP member Theodor Wolff.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; new_middle_ddp += 6; old_middle_ddp += 4; rural_ddp += 3; workers_ddp += 4; unemployed_ddp += 3; catholics_ddp += 4; linksliberale_strength += 4; pro_republic += 4; nationalism -= 3; socialism -= 3

We have funded the Berliner Tageblatt, and with its wide circulation, we see a noticeable increase in support for us and for democracy.

@diehilfe
title: Fund Die Hilfe.
view-if: dh_integrated == 0
choose-if resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if dh_integrated = 1 : Die Hilfe has been integrated into our party's newspaper already, we would essentially be throwing funds at nothing. ?][? if resources < 1 : Not enough resources. ?]
subtitle: -1 resource, edited by herr Fredrich Naumann himself.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; new_middle_ddp += 6; rural_ddp += 4; catholics_ddp += 5; unemployed_ddp += 4; workers_ddp += 6 if yea_socialization_erkelenz = 1 and linksliberale_strength >= 25; linksliberale_strength += 5 if yea_socialization_erkelenz = 1 and linksliberale_strength >= 25; workers_ddp += 5 if yea_socialization_erkelenz = 0 and nationalliberale_strength < 25 and linksliberale_strength < 25; old_middle_ddp += 5 if yea_socialization_erkelenz = 0 and nationalliberale_strength < 25 and linksliberale_strength < 25; old_middle_ddp += 8 if yea_socialization_erkelenz = 0 and nationalliberale_strength >= 25; nationalliberale_strength += 5 if yea_socialization_erkelenz = 0 and nationalliberale_strength >= 25

Funding Die Hilfe certainly benefits us, as the editors are our most loyal members.

[? if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 1 and linksliberale_strenght >= 25 :  We see more of our grassroot members being attracted to the left-wing of our party, and our empowerment of them in the party has caused them to also take defacto control of the newspaper. ?] [? if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 0 and nationalliberale_strenght >= 25 : We see more of our grassroot members being aligned with the right wing of our party, as the empowerment of the more right-wing elements in the party has lead to Theodore Heuss taking de facto control of the newspaper. ?]

@echoderjungedemokratie
title: Fund the Echo der Junge Demokratie.
view-if: edjd_integrated == 0
choose-if: resources >= 1 and edjd_integrated = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Echo Der Junge Demokratie has been integrated into our party's newspaper already, we would essentialy be throwing funds at nothing.
subtitle: -1 resource, the newspaper of our Youth wing, herr Ludwig Quidde also publishes his writings here.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; young_democrats += 1; pazifisten_strength += 4; linksliberale_strength += 4; new_middle_ddp += 6; old_middle_ddp += 5; pro_republic += 3; nationalism -= 3

We have supported our youth wing's newspaper (wich is essentially suporting them), to which they have responded with enthusiasm. the pacifists have also became stronger because of this due to their link with the association.

@integrate1
title: Integrate Die Hilfe into our newspaper.
subtitle: -1 resource. We could integrate Die Hilfe into our existing newspaper network.
view-if: newspaper_founded = 1 and dh_integrated = 0 and newspaper_editor = "Theodor Heuss"
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; dh_integrated = 1; new_middle_campaign_modifier += 1; old_middle_campaign_modifier += 1; resources += 2

We have integrated Die Hilfe into our newspaper network,growing its influence significantly, and bringing with it funding and popularity.

@integrate2
title: We could integrate the Echo der Junge Demokratie and Die Hilfe into our newspaper network.
view-if: newspaper_founded = 1 and edjd_integrated = 0 and (newspaper_editor = "Anton Erkelenz" or newspaper_editor = "Ludwig Quidde")
subtitle: [? if young_democrats < 3 : -2 resources ?][? if young_democrats >= 3 : -1 resource, our investment into Echo der Junge Demokratie has reduced the cost ?]
choose-if: (resources >= 2 and young_democrats < 3) or (resources >= 1 and young_democrats >= 3)
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2 if young_democrats < 3; resources -= 1 if young_democrats >= 3; dh_integrated = 1; edjd_integrated = 1; new_middle_ddp += 6; workers_ddp += 5; old_middle_ddp += 6; workers_campaign_modifier += 1

We have integrated Echo der Junge Demokratie and Die Hilfe into our newspaper network, growing its influence significantly.

@bolsterpartymedia
title: We must continue to build up our newspaper network.
subtitle: [? if newspaper_invested_in > 3 : -1 resource. ?][? if newspaper_invested_in <= 3 : It is now financially self-sufficient and doesn't require further resources to grow. ?]
view-if: newspaper_founded = 1
choose-if: newspaper_invested_in <= 3
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1 if newspaper_invested_in > 3; newspaper_invested_in += 1; old_middle_ddp += 6 if newspaper_editor = "Theodor Heuss"; new_middle_ddp += 6 if newspaper_editor = "Theodor Heuss"; nationalism -= 4 if newspaper_editor = "Ludwig Quidde"; pro_republic += 4 if newspaper_editor = "Ludwig Quidde"; workers_ddp += 6 if newspaper_editor = "Anton Erkelenz"; new_middle_ddp += 6 if newspaper_editor = "Anton Erkelenz"

Our newspapr network has a mix of popular and political programming, and is proving a success in spreading our meseage.

@debate
title: Have vibrant ideological debates in the party newspaper.
view-if: newspaper_founded = 1
on-arrival: linksliberale_dissent -= 6 if linksliberale_dissent > 0; sammlung_dissent -= 6 if sammlung_dissent > 0; pazifisten_dissent -= 6 if pazifisten_dissent > 0; nationalliberale_dissent -= 6 if nationalliberale_dissent > 0; republikschutzer_dissent -= 6 if republikschutzer_dissent > 0

This is new for our party, since we didn't have a party newspaper before, but it has successfully paved over the many tensions in our party.

@partymedia
title: Perhaps we should create our official party media?
subtitle: -2 resources.
choose-if: resources >= 2 and newspaper_founded = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if newspaper_founded = 1 : We have already founded our party newspaper. ?][? if resources < 2 : Not enough resources. ?]
view-if: newspaper_founded = 0
on-arrival: newspaper_founded = 1; resources -= 2; newspaper_invested_in = 0

We have founded our own newspaper, and we must now select its head editor.

- @heuss
- @quide
- @erkelenz

@heuss
title: Theodor Heuss, a rising star in the Sammlung with a patriotic attitute.
choose-if: nationalliberale_strength + sammlung_strength > pazifisten_strength
unavailable-subtitle: The right and center lack the leverage to elevate Heuss to head editor.
on-arrival: newspaper_editor = "Theodor Heuss"; old_middle_campaign_modifier += 1; new_middle_campaign_modifier += 1; pro_republic += 4; nationalism += 4

We have chosen Heuss as the head editor, he is expected to steer the press to a more nationalist tone than our left liberals prefer, however his strong liberal stance quells any protests, at least for now.

@quide
title: Ludwig Quidde, head of the pacifist wing.
on-arrival: newspaper_editor = "Ludwig Quidde"; pro_republic_modifier += 1; nationalism_modifier += 1

The reknowned pacifist, Ludwig Quidde is chosen as head editor. He will make sure to criticize the ravaging nationalists on the far-right at all times and to promote pacifism amongst the German people.

@erkelenz
title: Anton Erkelenz, the labour leader.
choose-if: linksliberale_strength + pazifisten_strength > nationalliberale_strength + sammlung_strength
unavailable-subtitle: The left lacks the political capital to elect Erkelenz.
on-arrival: newspaper_editor = "Anton Erkelenz"; workers_campaign_modifier += 1; pro_republic += 3

Surprisingly, Anton Erkelenz is elected head editor of our party newspaper. It seems we will be focusing more on the lower classes than the middle class to promote liberal democracy to the common people. 
